
##Bug 101:
Issue Summary : In Main.c Pop events twice in main loop due this events getting lost.

Debug Observations: 
	• First event_queue_pop() consumes the event
	• Second event_queue_pop() finds nothing

Fix: Pop operation done only once, post fix Never pop the same queue twice.

##Bug 102:
Issue Summary : In Main.c   process '\r' and '\n' → EMPTY command → Unknown command

Debug Observations:
	• Most terminals send \r\n
	• \r → processes command it works.
	• \n → processes empty string it won't work.
	• Results That empty string prints: Unknown command.

Fix: ignore empty commands, 

==================================================
if (rx_char == '\r' || rx_char == '\n')
{
    if (rx_index > 0)
    {
        rx_buffer[rx_index] = '\0';
        command_processor_process(rx_buffer);
        rx_index = 0;
    }
}
==================================================

